<title>USA: Ameriwood names Foley president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Ameriwood names Foley president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameriwood Industries International Corp Tuesday said its board named Charles Foley president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Foley, who had served as the furniture and wood products maker's interim president and CEO since January 1996, was also appointed to a vacant seat on the company's board, increasing the number of directors to five.  Foley joined Ameriwood in June 1993 as a vice president.</p>
